// Claude Code config snippet — Unterm MCP server (project-scoped .mcp.json).
//
// PREREQUISITE: install the Unterm desktop app first (it ships the
// `unterm-cli mcp-stdio` bridge this config invokes). Download:
//
//     https://unterm.app/api/download
//
// Open Unterm once after install so its MCP server boots.
//
// File: drop this as `.mcp.json` in your project root. Claude Code picks it
// up automatically on the next session (project-scoped servers); for global,
// merge the mcpServers block into ~/.claude/.mcp.json (or whatever Claude
// Code uses on your platform — see https://docs.claude.com/claude-code).
//
// NOTE: if you launched Claude Code FROM inside an Unterm pane (Shell →
// AI Agents → Claude Code, or `unterm-cli agent launch claude-code`),
// Unterm auto-wires this config for you — you don't need to paste it.

{
  "mcpServers": {
    "unterm": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "unterm-cli",
      "args": ["mcp-stdio"]
    }
  }
}
